OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells. There
OL,7,Fwill be scattered showers, these
OL,8,Fbecoming fewer later in the afternoon.
OL,9,FWindy with fresh occasionally strong
OL,10,Fwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will see
OL,13,Fscattered showers, mainly in the west.
OL,14,FThen showers will become fewer and
OL,15,Flighter during the early hours. Fresh
OL,16,Fwesterly winds down.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FStarting off dry. Rain will
OL,19,Fspread from the west during the late
OL,20,Fmorning and afternoon, turning light
OL,21,Fand patchy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
