OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry, bright and breezy on Saturday,
OL,7,Fchance of a few showers across
OL,8,FLothian. Dry for most of Sunday but
OL,9,Fchance of rain later. Early rain on
OL,10,FMonday then dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
